1
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:03,160
<i>Are you crazy? Why are you doing this?</i>

2
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:05,000
<i>I'm trying to save our marriage.</i>

3
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,106
<i>I'm really disappointed in you.</i>

4
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,440
<i>Yo!</i>

5
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:13,480
<i>You expect me to stay and
be a throuple with you two?</i>

6
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:16,120
<i>I swear, I had no idea
what I was doing just now.</i>

7
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:18,040
<i>Tell them exactly what I told you.</i>

8
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,880
<i>I saw ghosts following you.</i>

9
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:20,953
<i>You lying bitch!</i>

10
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:27,480
<i>When the mind is clear,
and if we share a karmic connection,</i>

11
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:29,623
<i>we may be able to see the spirit world.</i>

12
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,686
What is this?

13
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,853
Pan is here, sir.

14
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:16,720
Pan, go get Yohd and Sali.
Bring them to me now.

15
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,160
Didn't you hear me?

16
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:28,440
Bring Yohd and Sali to me now!

17
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,200
Yes, sir.

18
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:50,146
I can't do it. I can't.

19
00:02:50,713 --> 00:02:52,333
Why does it have to be me?

20
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,800
What's wrong, Pan?

21
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:48,633
Master Lert ordered me
to bring Yohd and Sali to serve him.

22
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,200
I'll speak to Master Lert myself.

23
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,166
Thank you, Uncle.

24
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,760
Master Lert, please.

25
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,560
Have mercy on Pan.

26
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,720
Sali is pregnant.

27
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:13,546
You dare defy my order?

28
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:16,120
No, sir.

29
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:19,120
I'd even give my life for you, Master Lert.

30
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,560
I only ask for your mercy.

31
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:26,693
Then death is the only mercy I'll give you.

32
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,240
[Old House V1 - May 3]
[Western-style, Amarit, Phak Hai]

33
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:57,800
[A monument to scandal]
[from the reign of King Rama V]

34
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:05,440
[The Thanahirankit family hid behind]
["Master Lert", a powerful tycoon.]

35
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:08,440
[He had deeply perverse sexual desires.]

36
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:13,040
[To improve her life, Sroi began]
[catering to his bizarre desires.]

37
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:15,796
[Lert ordered both male slaves and...]

38
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:23,876
That house you asked me to look into...

39
00:05:23,876 --> 00:05:25,280
There's nothing suspicious, Pete.

40
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:29,120
It's just an old family home.
Locals clean it now and then.

41
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:31,160
No one's lived there for over 10 years.

42
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,560
But when I went inside,

43
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:37,200
I felt like I wasn't alone.

44
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:39,960
Like that double-murder affair last year?

45
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:42,200
A ghost led you to the evidence.

46
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,533
<i>- Bag this as evidence.
- Yes, sir.</i>

47
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:26,400
But the house we're investigating
is over a hundred years old, Jom.

48
00:06:28,626 --> 00:06:32,000
I have a feeling something's waiting inside.

49
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,560
Maybe it doesn't want our help.

50
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:37,166
Maybe it wants to tell us something.

51
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:13,080
The first riser is off by two centimeters.

52
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:15,000
It doesn't match the drawings.

53
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,720
It's only two centimeters.

54
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:20,193
I'll add a topping to level the floor,

55
00:07:20,193 --> 00:07:23,723
raise it, and finish it off.

56
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:27,800
Raising the entire floor just to fix one stair

57
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:30,480
adds unnecessary dead load
and cost to the project.

58
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,560
That's just cutting corners.

59
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:37,120
But it's only two centimeters.

60
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,760
Hardly anyone will notice.

61
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:41,440
They may not see it,
but they'll feel it when they walk.

62
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,420
It may not cost you anything,

63
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:47,600
but the developer has to pay
for that extra topping.

64
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:49,316
That's not right.

65
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:54,240
Chip it out and redo the leveling.

66
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,240
Follow the exact level I specified,

67
00:07:56,240 --> 00:08:00,010
so it won't affect the architectural work
and will meet construction standards.

68
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:03,400
Yes, Nat. I'll have the team fix it right away.

69
00:08:04,616 --> 00:08:06,283
Make sure it's done right.

70
00:08:11,942 --> 00:08:14,183
I'm glad we'll be working together
on the new project.

71
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,403
Thank you. Goodbye.

72
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,990
Nat, watch out!

73
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:34,480
I'm sorry, Nat.

74
00:08:38,223 --> 00:08:39,240
I'm so sorry, Nat.

75
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,160
What are you guys doing?

76
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:44,876
Good thing I was wearing a hard hat,
or my head would've been split open.

77
00:08:45,623 --> 00:08:49,080
Don't let this happen again, or you're fired.

78
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,400
Yes, Nat.

79
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:04,200
Nat, this can't be a coincidence.

80
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,040
Strange things keep happening to you.

81
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:08,439
I think...

82
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,840
you should see a fortune teller with me.

83
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:14,463
It's human error, not bad luck.

84
00:09:14,463 --> 00:09:18,120
I believe in site management, not superstition.

85
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,596
Listen, Nat.

86
00:09:19,596 --> 00:09:21,640
Since this project started,

87
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:24,315
there've been accidents and rework.

88
00:09:24,315 --> 00:09:26,501
The machinery keeps breaking down.

89
00:09:26,501 --> 00:09:28,293
And just now, you almost...

90
00:09:32,015 --> 00:09:34,120
Please, Nat.

91
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:36,200
Just go see my fortune teller.

92
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,840
Do it for me.

93
00:09:40,475 --> 00:09:42,621
Just to put my mind at ease.

94
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:50,520
Clear your mind,

95
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:52,288
then draw three cards each.

96
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:09,936
The cards you've drawn reveal
what's within you and what's to come.

97
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:16,280
The Wheel of Fortune.

98
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:20,813
The wheel of fate is in a bad position.

99
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:25,880
It means the cycle will turn,
bringing back your karma.

100
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:34,520
Harming and abusing others.

101
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,140
<i>Whip her!</i>

102
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:48,080
A severe consequence that
could bring everything to an end.

103
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,040
Total defeat.

104
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:13,623
The Devil.

105
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,840
The abuse of power.

106
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,640
I ordered you to bring Sali to me now!

107
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:19,986
Lust and desire.

108
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:25,000
Imprisoning or controlling
others through obsession.

109
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:34,560
Karma that will strike without warning.

110
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,000
I want each of you to draw one more card.

111
00:11:51,959 --> 00:11:53,226
It's all right.

112
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:56,206
That card belongs to both of you.

113
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,247
Justice.

114
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:10,360
You reap what you sow.

115
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,970
This is ridiculous.

116
00:12:11,970 --> 00:12:14,480
A few cards can't decide someone's fate.

117
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:19,080
I believe in what I've built myself,
not these pieces of paper.

118
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:21,000
Look back and reflect.

119
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,360
You too.

120
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:27,800
Make things right before your luck turns.

121
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:30,800
Once your luck turns,

122
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:32,653
nothing can stop what's coming.

123
00:12:33,593 --> 00:12:35,903
Those you've wronged
will come to collect their debt.

124
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:45,480
I've been waiting for the day
I make you all pay.

125
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,646
Bastard Lert!

126
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,400
Bitch Bulan!

127
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:58,923
Nat, do you think what I did was wrong?

128
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,800
About Yo?

129
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,630
If you're wrong, so am I.

130
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:11,480
Do you think Yo will get back at us?

131
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:18,400
From what I know of Yo,
she's not the vengeful type.

132
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:26,120
Then who do you think
would hold a grudge against us?

133
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:31,880
I don't know.

134
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:18,166
How did a crow get in here?

135
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:25,280
<i>Those you've wronged
will come to collect their debt.</i>

136
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:28,480
<i>The day you see a crow,</i>

137
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,813
<i>is the day karma begins to work.</i>

138
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,653
<i>Nat.</i>

139
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,000
<i>Nat!</i>

140
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:17,400
Pam, what's wrong?

141
00:16:17,400 --> 00:16:18,693
Nat,

142
00:16:18,693 --> 00:16:20,320
I had a nightmare.

143
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:21,920
It was terrifying.

144
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,240
<i>Yo,</i>

145
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,880
<i>I had a really bad dream last night.</i>

146
00:16:47,640 --> 00:16:50,400
<i>It was pitch-dark.</i>

147
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:53,053
<i>I saw you crying in an old house.</i>

148
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:57,640
Then I saw three shadows surrounding you.

149
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:00,000
They seemed really angry with you.

150
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,720
Thanks for worrying about me, Pim.

151
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:06,200
<i>That dream really worries me.</i>

152
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:08,240
Go make some merit, okay?

153
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:11,193
I just did.

154
00:17:11,193 --> 00:17:12,980
Good.

155
00:17:12,980 --> 00:17:14,167
And...

156
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:16,840
how are things with your husband?

157
00:17:18,520 --> 00:17:21,606
Nat's been working really hard lately.

158
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,640
<i>And what about those women?</i>

159
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:38,699
If you put aside the women I told you about,

160
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:45,960
Nat's actually a good man, Pim.

161
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:49,687
What kind of good man keeps cheating on you?

162
00:17:49,687 --> 00:17:52,255
If he's seeing other women,
how is he a good man?

163
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:57,309
You've got a point.

164
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:04,560
But I'm out of work right now,

165
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:07,400
and Nat supports me in every way.

166
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:10,883
So you're just going to put up with this?

167
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:13,280
<i>Nothing to say again?</i>

168
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:16,720
<i>If it were me, I'd have left
after the first one.</i>

169
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:19,340
<i>But you've put up with two of them.</i>

170
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:22,000
I just want you to face reality.

171
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:26,240
<i>Goodness bought with money
isn't really goodness.</i>

172
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:52,120
<i>Who's that?</i>

173
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:53,360
<i>My boss.</i>

174
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:55,327
<i>Stay away from another woman's husband, Whan.</i>

175
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:14,760
Don't change your password yet, Pete.

176
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:26,206
Ayutthaya.

177
00:19:31,760 --> 00:19:33,386
Am I bothering you?

178
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,666
You seem a little off.

179
00:19:41,666 --> 00:19:44,246
I haven't slept well for days.

180
00:19:44,246 --> 00:19:46,830
I'm exhausted.

181
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:50,933
Okay.

182
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:54,640
Then I'll get going so you can get some rest.

183
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:10,280
I had some work nearby,

184
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:12,680
so I stopped by to talk about the house.

185
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,333
I had a friend look into it.

186
00:20:14,333 --> 00:20:16,726
There's really nothing unusual there.

187
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,233
There is.

188
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,946
I had a feeling there was something too.

189
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:25,520
So I checked some old-house pages.

190
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:28,160
Someone wrote about it,

191
00:20:29,840 --> 00:20:31,240
but there was nothing useful.

192
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:34,840
You have to help us. You have to help us.

193
00:20:34,840 --> 00:20:37,459
Hey... Hey!

194
00:20:37,459 --> 00:20:40,040
You have to help us! You have to help us!

195
00:20:40,040 --> 00:20:41,640
You have to help us!

196
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:43,560
Do you hear me? You have to help us!

197
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:44,613
Hey!

198
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:49,040
You must help us! You must help us!

199
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:51,000
Hey!

200
00:20:55,360 --> 00:20:57,543
Hey! Are you okay?

201
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,756
Hey!

202
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:06,240
<i>I'm afraid Yo might file for divorce.</i>

203
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:08,553
<i>Do you have anything we can use
to blackmail her?</i>

204
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:16,899
The first riser was off by two centimeters.

205
00:21:16,899 --> 00:21:20,200
It didn't match the drawings,
so I had the crew chip it out.

206
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:22,560
They've redone the leveling.

207
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:34,080
What's up, Whan?

208
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:36,800
I found something we can use against Yo.

209
00:21:37,840 --> 00:21:38,960
Send it to me.

210
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:05,680
Hey!

211
00:22:08,840 --> 00:22:09,920
Hey!

212
00:22:15,200 --> 00:22:16,600
Hey...

213
00:22:32,080 --> 00:22:33,506
What happened to me?

214
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:37,620
You grabbed my arm really hard

215
00:22:39,467 --> 00:22:40,840
and kept saying,

216
00:22:40,840 --> 00:22:43,760
"You have to help us. You have to help us."

217
00:22:43,760 --> 00:22:45,280
Then you passed out.

218
00:22:50,279 --> 00:22:52,693
Maybe it's trying to tell us something.

219
00:22:57,360 --> 00:22:58,920
Yeah...

220
00:22:58,920 --> 00:23:01,000
A few nights ago, I was meditating

221
00:23:02,393 --> 00:23:04,286
and saw people here.

222
00:23:05,760 --> 00:23:07,440
They were slaves.

223
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:11,560
It looked so real.

224
00:23:12,280 --> 00:23:14,736
Like I'd been pulled into their past.

225
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:17,440
Then the altar caught fire.

226
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:24,120
That's when I came out of the vision.

227
00:23:32,253 --> 00:23:34,993
You may think I'm crazy,

228
00:23:34,993 --> 00:23:36,253
but I'm telling you the truth.

229
00:23:37,280 --> 00:23:40,760
Besides the slaves, did you see anyone else?

230
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:45,640
I saw all three of them.

231
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:47,966
Nat,

232
00:23:48,773 --> 00:23:49,853
Pam,

233
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:52,000
Whan.

234
00:24:25,246 --> 00:24:28,247
Don't be a fool. Don't go soft on them.

235
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:37,600
They're evil.

236
00:24:37,600 --> 00:24:39,893
You need to know the whole truth.

237
00:24:55,372 --> 00:24:58,173
We'll show you what really happened.

238
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:18,240
Yohd, I got more Pikul and Sai Yud flowers.

239
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:21,146
Sai Yud smells so lovely.

240
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:26,600
I know... but even Sai Yud can't compete

241
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:28,960
with the love you two have.

242
00:25:30,207 --> 00:25:33,773
Sali's already pregnant.

243
00:25:33,773 --> 00:25:37,003
But Pan still acts like they're newlyweds.

244
00:25:38,753 --> 00:25:40,686
She's my wife.

245
00:25:40,686 --> 00:25:42,253
Of course, I really love her.

246
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:49,960
Sali!

247
00:25:50,840 --> 00:25:52,000
Sali!

248
00:25:58,407 --> 00:26:02,606
That's why I need to earn
enough to buy our freedom.

249
00:26:03,320 --> 00:26:06,120
Our parents would be so happy, Yohd.

250
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:10,219
Once the baby's born,

251
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:13,946
we'll finally all be together.

252
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:20,366
I don't think it'll be that easy.

253
00:26:23,433 --> 00:26:25,210
Master Lert wants to see you.

254
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:45,160
Hurry up and wash Master Lert and Bulan's feet.

255
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:48,480
- Yes.
- Always have to be told.

256
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:27,080
Sali!

257
00:27:27,080 --> 00:27:30,896
How dare you behave so disgracefully
in front of Master Lert!

258
00:27:34,080 --> 00:27:36,240
Forgive her, Bulan.

259
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:39,000
Sali's having terrible morning sickness.

260
00:27:42,320 --> 00:27:45,440
No wonder you've filled out so nicely.

261
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:49,200
You certainly did the job, Pan.

262
00:27:52,360 --> 00:27:54,400
Do your parents know the good news yet?

263
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:56,240
Not yet, sir.

264
00:27:58,679 --> 00:28:00,416
Do you want them to?

265
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:04,663
Yes, sir.

266
00:28:06,760 --> 00:28:08,680
Then come to my room tonight.

267
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:19,287
Master Lert, please. Let me serve you instead.

268
00:28:19,287 --> 00:28:20,980
Sali isn't well.

269
00:28:25,039 --> 00:28:26,803
You said it yourself, Pan.

270
00:28:30,480 --> 00:28:31,520
Yes, sir.

271
00:28:35,760 --> 00:28:38,116
Then come to my room tonight.

272
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:54,740
Bulan.

273
00:28:59,080 --> 00:29:02,450
What does Master Lert want Pan to do for him?

274
00:29:03,280 --> 00:29:05,000
How dare you ask me?

275
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:08,720
Sali has terrible morning sickness.

276
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:14,943
Please let Pan stay and take care of his wife.

277
00:29:17,399 --> 00:29:19,843
So you'll serve Master Lert instead?

278
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:24,040
Yes, my lady.

279
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:28,566
You said it yourself, Yohd.

280
00:29:42,600 --> 00:29:45,590
Hurry up, Pan. I'm tired of waiting.

281
00:29:47,760 --> 00:29:50,303
Master Lert, I can't do this.

282
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:54,400
And the only woman I love is Sali.

283
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:55,570
Love?

284
00:29:56,792 --> 00:29:58,120
You're a slave.

285
00:29:58,920 --> 00:30:00,846
You have no right to love.

286
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:04,440
Hurry, Pan.

287
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,440
Do as Master Lert says.

288
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:10,556
You know how terrifying
Master Lert is when he's angry.

289
00:30:11,667 --> 00:30:15,014
Or do you want your wife Sali
to suffer because of you?

290
00:30:17,400 --> 00:30:19,653
If you won't do it with Yohd while I watch,

291
00:30:19,653 --> 00:30:21,680
I'll have Sali dragged here,

292
00:30:21,680 --> 00:30:23,800
then I'll do it with her in front of you.

293
00:30:38,919 --> 00:30:41,626
Yohd, I'm sorry.

294
00:31:07,880 --> 00:31:10,919
Here. A tonic.

295
00:31:10,919 --> 00:31:12,320
Drink it.

296
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:18,930
It'll get you in the mood.

297
00:33:21,200 --> 00:33:22,240
Yo!

298
00:33:25,739 --> 00:33:27,086
Yo!

299
00:33:27,086 --> 00:33:28,086
Yo!

300
00:33:28,680 --> 00:33:30,159
Yo!

301
00:33:30,159 --> 00:33:31,159
Yo!

302
00:33:34,040 --> 00:33:35,640
Yo!

303
00:33:37,286 --> 00:33:38,286
Yo!

304
00:33:38,973 --> 00:33:40,573
Yo!

305
00:33:41,280 --> 00:33:42,320
Yo!

306
00:33:57,360 --> 00:33:58,800
What's up, Nat?

307
00:33:58,800 --> 00:34:01,400
Yo passed out. I don't know what happened.

308
00:34:01,400 --> 00:34:04,040
I'm not sure if it's because
she fell down the stairs.

309
00:34:04,040 --> 00:34:07,910
I checked her insurance. It expired last week.

310
00:34:08,540 --> 00:34:11,080
I want to take her
to the best hospital possible.

311
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:12,400
Can you help me?

312
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:16,920
Of course.

313
00:34:16,920 --> 00:34:18,843
I'll call an ambulance right away.

314
00:34:19,560 --> 00:34:21,009
Thank you so much.

315
00:34:23,280 --> 00:34:26,273
Yo... Yo...

316
00:34:49,720 --> 00:34:51,120
Yo,

317
00:34:51,120 --> 00:34:52,238
Yo,

318
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,520
how are you feeling?

319
00:34:56,880 --> 00:34:59,680
Yo, what happened?

320
00:34:59,680 --> 00:35:01,899
Why were you lying on the landing?

321
00:35:08,280 --> 00:35:09,926
I'm glad you're okay.

322
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:28,760
Why did you bring me here?

323
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:32,360
I was worried about you.

324
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:36,506
So I asked Pam for help.

325
00:35:48,720 --> 00:35:50,031
Yo...

326
00:35:51,080 --> 00:35:52,400
What are you doing?

327
00:35:54,680 --> 00:35:58,706
Yo, don't. Please don't get angry.

328
00:35:58,706 --> 00:36:01,376
I'm not angry at you or her.

329
00:36:01,376 --> 00:36:04,440
I'm angry at myself. I have no job, no money,

330
00:36:04,440 --> 00:36:06,936
no dignity. I have nothing.

331
00:36:08,800 --> 00:36:10,000
I'm going home.

332
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:11,200
Yo. Listen to me.

333
00:36:11,200 --> 00:36:12,320
Ouch, Nat!

334
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:13,920
Yo, come on.

335
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:16,500
We're fighting about
the same thing all over again.

336
00:36:17,980 --> 00:36:20,007
I really didn't want to bring this up,

337
00:36:20,760 --> 00:36:22,720
but you've been picking fights so much,

338
00:36:22,720 --> 00:36:25,240
I'm starting to think you're cheating.

339
00:36:25,240 --> 00:36:26,553
What?

340
00:36:32,359 --> 00:36:33,553
Here.

341
00:36:36,520 --> 00:36:39,380
There's nothing going on between Pete and me.

342
00:36:39,380 --> 00:36:42,000
Then why were you holding
onto each other in my house?

343
00:36:44,280 --> 00:36:46,294
How did you even meet him?

344
00:36:46,294 --> 00:36:47,880
He's been helping me with my work.

345
00:36:47,880 --> 00:36:49,283
What work?

346
00:36:49,283 --> 00:36:51,587
Then why were you holding each other like that?

347
00:36:55,680 --> 00:36:57,759
I don't know, Nat.

348
00:36:57,759 --> 00:37:00,113
I just didn't feel like myself.

349
00:37:00,113 --> 00:37:02,189
What about me and Whan?

350
00:37:02,189 --> 00:37:04,640
We said we were possessed.

351
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:07,080
You didn't believe us.
But now you say you weren't yourself?

352
00:37:07,080 --> 00:37:08,996
I really don't know.

353
00:37:09,880 --> 00:37:11,319
Okay.

354
00:37:11,319 --> 00:37:15,420
Then you have to believe
Whan and I didn't know either.

355
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:29,960
I didn't do it.

356
00:37:29,960 --> 00:37:32,080
I didn't possess them.

357
00:37:33,080 --> 00:37:37,837
That bastard Lert is evil!
I didn't possess them.

358
00:37:37,837 --> 00:37:39,200
I didn't do it!

359
00:37:39,200 --> 00:37:42,600
That bastard Lert is evil!

360
00:37:42,600 --> 00:37:46,480
I didn't possess them!

361
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:50,480
I didn't possess them!

362
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:53,583
I didn't possess them!

363
00:38:41,280 --> 00:38:43,020
I came to see how you're doing.

364
00:38:43,840 --> 00:38:46,160
Get well soon, Yo.

365
00:38:46,160 --> 00:38:48,333
I'm genuinely worried about you, Yo.

366
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:59,760
Why are you two here?

367
00:38:59,760 --> 00:39:01,400
To take care of you.

368
00:39:02,493 --> 00:39:06,833
Nat was really upset
when you passed out in front of him.

369
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:11,886
But he's also wondering if you're really sick,

370
00:39:12,953 --> 00:39:15,871
or just trying to get
attention because of that man.

371
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:19,468
There's nothing between Pete and me.

372
00:39:19,468 --> 00:39:22,531
And I don't need your help either.

373
00:39:22,531 --> 00:39:24,119
Don't be so quick to refuse.

374
00:39:24,119 --> 00:39:27,247
Your insurance expired. You're jobless.

375
00:39:27,880 --> 00:39:30,480
If I hadn't taken care of everything,

376
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:34,520
you'd be in a charity ward
at some public hospital by now.

377
00:39:38,560 --> 00:39:41,440
I'll pay back every baht.

378
00:39:41,440 --> 00:39:42,880
Don't bother.

379
00:39:42,880 --> 00:39:46,560
Consider it payment for
taking care of Nat all these years.

380
00:39:48,480 --> 00:39:52,200
Now you're free to be with Pete,

381
00:39:52,200 --> 00:39:54,695
and let Nat be happy for once.

382
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:57,035
That's right.

383
00:39:58,280 --> 00:40:01,000
Pete and I are completely over.

384
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:05,320
If you want to take over, I don't mind at all.

385
00:40:06,320 --> 00:40:09,095
Then we'd be even.

386
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:12,918
I still have my morals.

387
00:40:12,918 --> 00:40:14,600
I've never cheated on my husband.

388
00:40:14,600 --> 00:40:16,500
Morals don't put food on the table.

389
00:40:17,215 --> 00:40:22,933
In the real world,
only those with power get to decide

390
00:40:22,933 --> 00:40:25,860
what's right and what's wrong.

391
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:30,421
Settle things with Nat soon.

392
00:40:30,421 --> 00:40:34,447
Before my good intentions
turn into something else.

393
00:40:57,313 --> 00:40:58,653
How are you?

394
00:41:01,320 --> 00:41:02,720
Better.

395
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:05,342
Pete,

396
00:41:06,039 --> 00:41:08,720
someone secretly took a photo of us
and sent it to Nat.

397
00:41:08,720 --> 00:41:10,560
Do you know who took it?

398
00:41:11,726 --> 00:41:13,027
Whan, of course.

399
00:41:15,040 --> 00:41:16,462
I'm worried about you.

400
00:41:21,359 --> 00:41:24,513
The last time I saw you, you weren't yourself.

401
00:41:28,080 --> 00:41:32,294
And you told me you saw people in a vision.

402
00:41:34,560 --> 00:41:36,167
Are you still seeing them?

403
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:38,241
Yes.

404
00:41:38,241 --> 00:41:41,560
Now I'm certain there are spirits in the house.

405
00:41:42,160 --> 00:41:45,080
Then we've got a lot of investigating to do.

406
00:41:45,080 --> 00:41:47,117
I want to know the truth too.

407
00:41:49,560 --> 00:41:52,315
Those spirits really hate Nat.

408
00:41:55,640 --> 00:41:57,347
I just want him to be safe.

409
00:42:05,640 --> 00:42:07,151
Why do you keep taking pictures?

410
00:42:13,040 --> 00:42:15,760
Today's a special day for us,

411
00:42:15,760 --> 00:42:18,634
so I wanted a photo to remember it by.

412
00:42:28,040 --> 00:42:30,990
I tried to open up to Yo today.

413
00:42:30,990 --> 00:42:33,000
But I don't know what she'll think.

414
00:42:34,362 --> 00:42:36,006
Let her think whatever she wants.

415
00:42:36,006 --> 00:42:37,713
I don't care anymore.

416
00:42:37,713 --> 00:42:39,608
I'm tired of it.

417
00:42:39,608 --> 00:42:41,349
With Yo, there's always some drama.

418
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:43,904
It's better if she has someone else.

419
00:42:43,904 --> 00:42:45,366
Aren't you jealous?

420
00:42:45,366 --> 00:42:47,520
I know you still love her.

421
00:42:47,520 --> 00:42:51,024
If Yo were sweet and easygoing,
I wouldn't do anything to her.

422
00:42:51,593 --> 00:42:56,106
But if I can't control her,
I'll use that guy as leverage.

423
00:43:23,600 --> 00:43:24,800
What's up, Yo?

424
00:43:25,680 --> 00:43:28,391
Meet me at home. We need to talk.

425
00:43:39,040 --> 00:43:40,846
There's nothing between Pete and me.

426
00:43:40,846 --> 00:43:42,840
Whan took that photo on purpose.

427
00:43:42,840 --> 00:43:44,320
You've said that many times.

428
00:43:44,320 --> 00:43:45,640
I'm just making it clear.

429
00:43:45,640 --> 00:43:48,560
Then I'll say this again too.
Whan and I were possessed.

430
00:43:51,200 --> 00:43:53,888
I don't know what happened between us.

431
00:43:55,074 --> 00:43:56,450
But I saw it.

432
00:43:57,746 --> 00:43:59,146
Saw what?

433
00:44:01,320 --> 00:44:02,760
The three of you in the past.

434
00:44:07,720 --> 00:44:09,850
You hurt people, and they want revenge.

435
00:44:10,440 --> 00:44:14,307
If you, Pam, and Whan are bound
by karma from the past,

436
00:44:15,360 --> 00:44:16,800
I forgive you.

437
00:44:16,800 --> 00:44:19,040
- No! I won't forgive them!
- I'll have my revenge!

438
00:44:19,040 --> 00:44:21,040
You'll all die in agony!

439
00:44:31,120 --> 00:44:34,482
- Yo!
- You must die!

440
00:44:38,520 --> 00:44:40,360
<i>Nat has to become a monk.</i>

441
00:44:40,360 --> 00:44:42,382
<i>Over some crazy dream you had?</i>

442
00:44:43,000 --> 00:44:45,640
<i>I saw what they did to them.</i>

443
00:44:45,640 --> 00:44:49,280
<i>They can't forgive their souls being trapped,
unable to be reborn.</i>

444
00:44:49,280 --> 00:44:50,520
<i>Is there any way to fix this?</i>

445
00:44:50,520 --> 00:44:55,304
<i>The three from the past,
Lert, Bulan, and Sroi must die.</i>

446
00:44:56,000 --> 00:44:58,740
<i>Look what they did to you.</i>

447
00:45:03,240 --> 00:45:04,480
<i>Yo!</i>

448
00:45:05,320 --> 00:45:06,520
<i>I'm not Yo.</i>

449
00:45:06,520 --> 00:45:08,512
<i>I'll get every last one of you.</i>
